- [ ] Is the connection pool configured correctly?
- [ ] Are tests using isolated connection pools?
- [ ] Are stale connections being detected?
- [ ] Is the connection pool size appropriate?
- [ ] Are connection timeouts and idle timeouts set?
- [ ] Is the connection pool being closed after tests?

---

